Description:
When horizontally deployed within an atrium, the streamlined modules evoke a processional experience;
Vertically stacked in an office building elevator lobby, they construct a corridor of light imbued with striking orderly beauty.
This inherent adaptability transforms space from a 'functional container' into a 'generator of value'.​

